       en="The **imperfect** (έπαιζε, έδιναν, έβαφαν) describes repeated or typical actions in the past — the roles an actor *used to* play, what audiences *kept* doing — while the **aorist** marks single completed events (*γύρισε 187 ταινίες*, *πέθανε το 1977*). The present passive **προβάλλονται** “are (regularly) shown” carries the same habitual idea into today.",
